{"4889070": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "GALMEGI", "steam_appid": 4889070, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889070/extras/07da35ea92d6f43d8e5c0eed471f2769.poster.avif?t=1784748172\" width=554 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889070/extras/07da35ea92d6f43d8e5c0eed471f2769.webm?t=1784748172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889070/extras/07da35ea92d6f43d8e5c0eed471f2769.mp4?t=1784748172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Become Untamed. Become a Beast.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a city where swagger is currency, violence is language, and the weak are crushed first, you begin as a bottom-rank gang member in Posan City, only to be dragged deeper and deeper into a more dangerous world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rules of survival here are simple. Never show weakness. Overwhelm those weaker than you. When you stand before someone stronger, bow low and wait for your next chance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889070/extras/0ddf0ae13a0fb4ade4fc0c30fadda807.poster.avif?t=1784748172\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889070/extras/0ddf0ae13a0fb4ade4fc0c30fadda807.webm?t=1784748172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889070/extras/0ddf0ae13a0fb4ade4fc0c30fadda807.mp4?t=1784748172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Physics-Kinematic Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A punch does not come out with a single button press. You must lean your body, adjust your attack trajectory, and read your enemy’s timing. Every attack produces a completely different result depending on direction, charge, recovery, distance, and impact angle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with different fighting stances and attacks, discover the optimal trajectory, and punish your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889070/extras/4466676289d1ab97e3d4712fb3ca7696.poster.avif?t=1784748172\" width=434 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889070/extras/4466676289d1ab97e3d4712fb3ca7696.webm?t=1784748172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889070/extras/4466676289d1ab97e3d4712fb3ca7696.mp4?t=1784748172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Swagger System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Money? It is meaningless. It gets paid upward and disappears. What truly matters in this world is swagger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat your enemies to gain swagger. Stake your swagger to pressure your opponent, or overpower them without even starting a fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring your enemies to their knees and become stronger. If you cannot, then at least pretend to be strong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889070/extras/9861bc65fd21c8da6f5297099c4914dc.avif?t=1784748172\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889070/extras_big/9861bc65fd21c8da6f5297099c4914dc.avif?t=1784748172 width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Intimidation and One-on-One Brawls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No matter who stands before you, do not flinch. Stare them down first. Some will hand over their money. Others will start a fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Judge your opponent by their clothes, build, posture, gaze, and reputation. Community posts, eyewitness accounts, and saved photos may contain vital clues that decide whether you live or die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read your enemies, and force those weaker than you into submission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may receive rewards you never expected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889070/extras/caf5220758b6bd69cc18fe3ba93dcecf.poster.avif?t=1784748172\" width=760 height=428 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889070/extras/caf5220758b6bd69cc18fe3ba93dcecf.webm?t=1784748172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889070/extras/caf5220758b6bd69cc18fe3ba93dcecf.mp4?t=1784748172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based one-on-one combat built around precise weaving and attack trajectory control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jabs, straights, hooks, uppercuts, charged attacks, near-misses, counters, hit stops, and execution follow-ups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-risk psychological confrontations where you stake your swagger to pressure your opponent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reactive AI that changes according to the situation and the player’s actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A noir story that casts a harsh light on both the floor and the ceiling, from cramped boarding rooms to luxury apartments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lives and endings that change according to your choices and decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889070/extras/4bb6669af45aa9922a6bb034e9db1db4.poster.avif?t=1784748172\" width=400 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889070/extras/4bb6669af45aa9922a6bb034e9db1db4.webm?t=1784748172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889070/extras/4bb6669af45aa9922a6bb034e9db1db4.mp4?t=1784748172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brothers.. our final battle is coming. Get ready for it..</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889070/extras/07da35ea92d6f43d8e5c0eed471f2769.poster.avif?t=1784748172\" width=554 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889070/extras/07da35ea92d6f43d8e5c0eed471f2769.webm?t=1784748172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889070/extras/07da35ea92d6f43d8e5c0eed471f2769.mp4?t=1784748172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Become Untamed. Become a Beast.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a city where swagger is currency, violence is language, and the weak are crushed first, you begin as a bottom-rank gang member in Posan City, only to be dragged deeper and deeper into a more dangerous world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The rules of survival here are simple. Never show weakness. Overwhelm those weaker than you. When you stand before someone stronger, bow low and wait for your next chance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889070/extras/0ddf0ae13a0fb4ade4fc0c30fadda807.poster.avif?t=1784748172\" width=654 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889070/extras/0ddf0ae13a0fb4ade4fc0c30fadda807.webm?t=1784748172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889070/extras/0ddf0ae13a0fb4ade4fc0c30fadda807.mp4?t=1784748172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Physics-Kinematic Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A punch does not come out with a single button press. You must lean your body, adjust your attack trajectory, and read your enemy’s timing. Every attack produces a completely different result depending on direction, charge, recovery, distance, and impact angle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with different fighting stances and attacks, discover the optimal trajectory, and punish your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889070/extras/4466676289d1ab97e3d4712fb3ca7696.poster.avif?t=1784748172\" width=434 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889070/extras/4466676289d1ab97e3d4712fb3ca7696.webm?t=1784748172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889070/extras/4466676289d1ab97e3d4712fb3ca7696.mp4?t=1784748172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Swagger System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Money? It is meaningless. It gets paid upward and disappears. What truly matters in this world is swagger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat your enemies to gain swagger. Stake your swagger to pressure your opponent, or overpower them without even starting a fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring your enemies to their knees and become stronger. If you cannot, then at least pretend to be strong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889070/extras/9861bc65fd21c8da6f5297099c4914dc.avif?t=1784748172\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889070/extras_big/9861bc65fd21c8da6f5297099c4914dc.avif?t=1784748172 width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Intimidation and One-on-One Brawls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No matter who stands before you, do not flinch. Stare them down first. Some will hand over their money. Others will start a fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Judge your opponent by their clothes, build, posture, gaze, and reputation. Community posts, eyewitness accounts, and saved photos may contain vital clues that decide whether you live or die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read your enemies, and force those weaker than you into submission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You may receive rewards you never expected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889070/extras/caf5220758b6bd69cc18fe3ba93dcecf.poster.avif?t=1784748172\" width=760 height=428 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889070/extras/caf5220758b6bd69cc18fe3ba93dcecf.webm?t=1784748172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889070/extras/caf5220758b6bd69cc18fe3ba93dcecf.mp4?t=1784748172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based one-on-one combat built around precise weaving and attack trajectory control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jabs, straights, hooks, uppercuts, charged attacks, near-misses, counters, hit stops, and execution follow-ups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High-risk psychological confrontations where you stake your swagger to pressure your opponent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reactive AI that changes according to the situation and the player’s actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A noir story that casts a harsh light on both the floor and the ceiling, from cramped boarding rooms to luxury apartments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lives and endings that change according to your choices and decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889070/extras/4bb6669af45aa9922a6bb034e9db1db4.poster.avif?t=1784748172\" width=400 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889070/extras/4bb6669af45aa9922a6bb034e9db1db4.webm?t=1784748172\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889070/extras/4bb6669af45aa9922a6bb034e9db1db4.mp4?t=1784748172\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brothers.. our final battle is coming. Get ready for it..</p>", "short_description": "Become Untamed. Become a Beast. In a city where swagger is currency, violence is language, and the weak are crushed first, you begin as a bottom-rank gang member in Posan City, only to be dragged deeper and deeper into a more dangerous world.", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese, Korean, Simplified Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889070/336d59ea7e4e0b2771b8e97cf9bff661f578657d/header.jpg?t=1784748172", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_